                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e251e54b-1df6-3c95-b3fa-bc1d80146522",
                        "entry_id": "50251aaf-9140-3641-9f6a-6d9997a9dfcc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A long armoured skirt, designed for combat on foot."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "60411c13-bd96-445c-a9f5-01a206c6838e",
                                "sense_id": "e251e54b-1df6-3c95-b3fa-bc1d80146522",
                                "text": "Accordingly, the Greenwich armoury hurriedly prepared a somewhat more conventional suit of foot combat armour made from existing pieces but incorporating newly made symmetrical pauldrons and a tonlet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "361bfc24-81c9-424b-a021-729cdb95bce0",
                                "sense_id": "e251e54b-1df6-3c95-b3fa-bc1d80146522",
                                "text": "On some the buttocks and groin are also fully encased in steel; while, on others, these same parts are protected by a tonlet, a deep steel skirt that widens downward to facilitate leg movement (see cat. 37)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "47a0c41a-bc88-39e3-a17e-2a67a903f86f",
                        "entry_id": "50251aaf-9140-3641-9f6a-6d9997a9dfcc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One of the plates which make up such a skirt."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "abe8a186-cf5a-44f2-a383-8af5664408d1",
                                "sense_id": "47a0c41a-bc88-39e3-a17e-2a67a903f86f",
                                "text": "Soon after this the six or eight \"tonlets\" grow fewer, being continued on the lower edge by the so-called tuilles, small plates strapped to the tonlets and swinging with the movement of the legs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "45252a28-323d-44ee-9d7d-5dcfd3c07cbe",
                                "sense_id": "47a0c41a-bc88-39e3-a17e-2a67a903f86f",
                                "text": "The steel tonlets are rigid, not overlapping and movable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a8696ba-543b-4a3a-be20-6d2c0def2fda",
                                "sense_id": "47a0c41a-bc88-39e3-a17e-2a67a903f86f",
                                "text": "His legs and thighs were similarly covered in plate, his loins by a mail apron over which was a short skirt of horizontal, overlapping plate 'tonlets'. His torso was protected by breast and back plates, the former reinforced […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
